{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1249525-enochian-lets-discuss","id":1249525,"title":"Enochian: lets discuss","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-28T14:10:19-07:00","id":1249525,"title":"Enochian: lets discuss","content":"Okay let\u2019s discuss Enochian. So in our world John Dee invented/Discovered Enochian in 1583, introduces as the language of angels, the name probably refers to the apocryphal book of Enoch were Enoch went to heaven to dwell with god.<br /> <br /> In the World of Darkness though, Enochian is used by the Tremere, and Hermetics, and I believe they were using it Hundreds of Years before John Dee.<br /> <br /> We also know from the Tal\u2019mahe\u2019rah that Enochian is actually just the phonetically derivation of Ghemlish, from the First City Ghemal before he coming of Caine. Now this was right after the war of Wrath with the Demons and Angels, or at least at the end of it.<br /> <br /> We know hermetics view Enochian as a magical language, and it seems to respond particularly well to awakened magic.<br /> <br /> So do you think Ghemlish is connected to the pre Babel Project Language? Or maybe one of the First languages after Babel that was preserved intact?<br /> <br /> Other comparably magical languages would be, the various Fera tongues, and the Spirit Language known to Dreamspeakers and other Shamans, and the Wu Lung know a Celestial Tongue.<br /> <br /> Makes me wonder a connection to Old Realm the Original Language of Creation in Exalted. <br /> <br /> What are some thoughts? Do we know how long the Vampires and Mages have known Enochian and where they got it from? We know the Blackhand Retained Ghemlish from the first city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T15:28:00-07:00","id":1249548,"title":"","content":"There are multiple versions.<br /> <br /> There's the one the Black Hand use. It's referred to an 'Enochian' but I don't know if it's meant to be the one Dee created or if it's merely called that because it was the language of Enoch.<br /> <br /> Demon seems to use Enochian to mean the language that angels/demons speak.<br /> <br /> The Order of Hermes Enochian (which is basically the Dee version) comes in two varieties: in 1e, Enochian is the language of the High Umbrood, which Hypatia the Alexandrian philosopher discovered, and Dee codified.<br /> In Revised, that history is implied to be a convenient fiction, and it's probably just an invention of the Renaissance; however it still works despite that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T21:48:39-07:00","id":1250967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1249525-enochian-lets-discuss#post1249525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> We also know from the Tal\u2019mahe\u2019rah that Enochian is actually just the phonetically derivation of Ghemlish, from the First City Ghemal before he coming of Caine. Now this was right after the war of Wrath with the Demons and Angels, or at least at the end of it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought that Ghemal was the name of Caine's Temple in Enoch (Or possibly created in the underworld after it's destruction) But the city was Enoch and the Language would be Enochian.<br /> <br /> All of the games under our group's main ST have Enochian as a pre-babel language which God has forbidden, and therefore, no one can understand anymore without magical intervention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16927-illithid","name":"Illithid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16927_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T22:06:27-07:00","id":1250970,"title":"","content":"I'm generally anti-crossover, but the way I've always played it is thus:<br /> <br /> Enochian, Ipwa, the Celestial Tongue, etc. are all the same language, just filtered through Paradigm and spirits' willingness to engage with given entities. &quot;Enochian&quot;, specifically, is a pidgin form of the language that has a pre-Mesopotamian written form, good for basic communication and commands, but no more -- however you justify it, Hermeticism is still a fundamentally utilitarian Paradigm with little room for excess or luxury. The impact it has on Awakened magic, is simply that Babel myths are so prevalent in prehistoric and early historic myths around the world, as are the mythological presence of sacred languages, they have rooted themselves so deeply in humanity's collective consciousness they still have a place in the Consensus.<br /> <br /> The John Dee stuff was pop-occult hogwash. Perhaps a play by the Hermetic Order to popularize their and <i>perhaps</i> the Chorus' Paradigm in the face of the growing dominance of the Order of Reason, but still hogwash.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":431,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","user":"Theodrim","date":". 09-03-2018, 01:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T12:17:29-07:00","id":1251138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illithid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1249525-enochian-lets-discuss?p=1250967#post1250967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I thought that Ghemal was the name of Caine's Temple in Enoch (Or possibly created in the underworld after it's destruction) But the city was Enoch and the Language would be Enochian.<br /> <br /> All of the games under our group's main ST have Enochian as a pre-babel language which God has forbidden, and therefore, no one can understand anymore without magical intervention.</div> </div> </div> </div>The V20 Blackhand book talks about Ghemal being the name of the city before it was renamed after Caine\u2019s childe Enoch. And the language of Enoch was Ghemlish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-25T05:45:21-07:00","id":1257173,"title":"","content":"There are mentions in DtF books that demons natively speak Enochian (in particular in the description of the First Tongue rite in Houses of the Fallen)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T07:33:26-07:00","id":1257768,"title":"","content":"When I have used Enochian, which has been exactly one time, it was a kind of bastardized language for angels to use when forced to work soley with the voice and not other means of communication that they may have possessed in the Aethyr. In this scenario it was an angel that fell from Heaven/Aethyr and our brave Mages (Mage the Awakening) were looking for the angel in competition with a mercenary Mage hired by a corrupt Hierophant to find that same. <br /> <br /> The way Enochian was used was that the angel was writing messanges in various places with hints that eventually allowed our characters to predcit the angel's movement and find him despite the lays of magical protection that envolved the angel. These messanges were partly frustration with being kicked from the Aethyr, wrath at Uriel for passing down that punishment to this angel, and also a kind of attempt to get into contact with someone. I imagine its kind of like someone getting lost in a city and trying to use an out-of-date phone catalogue to in touch with anyone who can help out or just updating status on Facebook saying &quot;Help! I'm lost in X, can someone help me out?!&quot;<br /> <br /> As for John Dee, I kind of figured that he didn't make the language up but was simply one of the few who wrote a guide to it and that reached the humna population in any significant number as to make an impact. But yeah John Dee was on to something but something that was essentially way beyond his comprehension to understand or manipulate given his lack of Awakening magic which was probably what saved him from some horrific fate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T11:15:46-07:00","id":1257805,"title":"","content":"Well.....<br /> <br /> Ennochian is basically the base code for reality. <br /> <br /> That being said. Whenever a demon or an angel uses it. it would be like modifying the whole program with out breaking it. like a computer developer works the code within.<br /> <br /> When mages discovered Ennochian they were sort of looking for a language that dominated reality. A source language.<br /> <br /> Using the metalenguage theory its stablished that learning different languages give different perspectives and ideals to the speaker, that the behaveour changes.<br /> If we pull a more....Out there example (The Arrival) we can figure out the idea that the dominion of Ennochian and the High Ennochian would be close enough to the original one that would allow such changes within reality to a level far beyond to the ones limited by paradox (Since its the original idea).<br /> <br /> Now, When mages use enochian is not enough Just because its a diluded version of it.<br /> <br /> <br /> To give a better example. Whenever a mage tries to speak in ennochian (in proper ennochian) its like trying to speak english through the Google Translator OR through the Monty Python Sketch (My hovercraft is full of Eels).<br /> <br /> While real proper ennochian would be like speaking old Classic English to quote shakespeare. <br /> <br /> <br /> Now. John Dee, i woudnt be surprised if he did some language routing work in order to go beyond Latin and back to the ancient babilonian and even before (Hyperborea if someone believes in such).<br /> <br /> Now my bet is, Dee was a member of the OoH but once he was discovered by the OoR he was forced to collaborate with them.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T11:19:30-07:00","id":1257807,"title":"","content":"Also, We know God left to Create the world of exalted. So<br /> <br /> We can consider Ennochian a Root Language. But phonetically we could easily say that Ghemilish is a variation based on the original one, maybe not having the same propierties but we can see it as a Low language within.<br /> <br /> Now, Fera is an interesting case. If we marry to the idea that Gaia is an Angel, i woudn't be surprised the idea of the Fera language as a tool to Limitate both the power and the capacities of the shapeshifters within certain domain as a control mechanism for both subconcious thought and others (Which in my case, would explain the stubborness of the garous)..Also, i can totally picture Fera being the equivalent of Klingon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T11:21:58-07:00","id":1257808,"title":"","content":"Hell now im seeing some videos of Metal gear 5 and i cant stop thinking of Skull Face as a good example of Enochian and language within the World of Darkness<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=saxI0Zu1ABI\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=saxI0Zu1ABI\" target=\"_bla